{"pin":"AB00980","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00980","anchor":"","first_line":"My God, my God! How can I make mention of Thee when the heart of 'Abdu'l-Bahá is consumed by the flames of yearning and the fire of ardent love? [3.5s]... ...O Lord!  My bones are weakened, and the hoar hairs glisten on My head ... and I have now reached old age, failing in My powers","first_line_orig":"الهی الهی کیف اذکرک و قلب عبدالبهاء تتاجج فیهه نار الجوی و نیران الاسنی من  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"390","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"KHAF.271","source":"KHAF","locator":"271","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/635.pdf#page=271"},{"kind":"publication","code":"KKD2.299x","source":"KKD2","locator":"299x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/08/kavakib-ad-durriyyah-vol-2-complete.pdf#page=151"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT3.242","source":"MKT3","locator":"242","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA3/ma3-242.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"GPB.310x","source":"GPB","locator":"310x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/432149072"}]},{"code":"AB00980CON","anchor":"con","translations":[{"language":"zh-Hant","lang_name":"Traditional Chinese"},{"language":"lb","lang_name":"Luxembourgish"},{"language":"vi","lang_name":"Vietnamese"},{"language":"iba","lang_name":"Iban"},{"language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"mn","lang_name":"Mongolian"}]}]}
